{"3748630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hazard Us", "steam_appid": 3748630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/28f5017cca46984288a4bb616d7a5749.avif?t=1783596493\" width=780 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends! Solve puzzles! Dodge traps! Die! A lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is <strong>Hazard Us</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard Us is a cooperative Adventure Game with chaotic and silly dangers around every corner. It will challenge players to use their wits, reactions and teamwork to survive. Can you complete your mission without losing your lives in the process?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/AboutThisGame3.png?t=1783596493\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this quirky, hilarious romp you and your fellow explorers will meet in your home base before heading off through a mystical portal to explore two adventures full of hidden dangers. Work together to solve physics based puzzles. Leap out of the way of dangers. Sip tea and brush up on your British accents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/AboutThisGame2.png?t=1783596493\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantastic Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay for 2–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two wild and whimsical time travelling, globe trotting adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles and perilous traps are everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home base hub to regroup and rehydrate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly surprises, optional tea breaks, and lots (and lots) of ways to die</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/28f5017cca46984288a4bb616d7a5749.avif?t=1783596493\" width=780 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends! Solve puzzles! Dodge traps! Die! A lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is <strong>Hazard Us</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hazard Us is a cooperative Adventure Game with chaotic and silly dangers around every corner. It will challenge players to use their wits, reactions and teamwork to survive. Can you complete your mission without losing your lives in the process?!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/AboutThisGame3.png?t=1783596493\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this quirky, hilarious romp you and your fellow explorers will meet in your home base before heading off through a mystical portal to explore two adventures full of hidden dangers. Work together to solve physics based puzzles. Leap out of the way of dangers. Sip tea and brush up on your British accents! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/extras/AboutThisGame2.png?t=1783596493\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantastic Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay for 2–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two wild and whimsical time travelling, globe trotting adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles and perilous traps are everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home base hub to regroup and rehydrate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly surprises, optional tea breaks, and lots (and lots) of ways to die</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Can you and your friends survive this VR puzzle adventure? You'll have to think fast, communicate well and dodge traps to solve your way to victory! Keep your eyes peeled, your brains engaged and your upper lips stiff! This world is Hazard Us!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/0488e47eb537f4eca002e651b4a3c4d366147a6f/header.jpg?t=1783596493", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/c5c28b859bfab362bfa5a515fea751a25f930a1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783596493", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748630/c5c28b859bfab362bfa5a515fea751a25f930a1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783596493", "website": "https://www.hazardusgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> VR ONLY, SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> VR ONLY</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Make Real", "Team Hazard